<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants attacked near the Kenya-Somalia border, killing eight people, and later claimed responsibility for assassinating a Somali intelligence officer in Mogadishu after a ten-year pursuit. Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing three, while the Somali National Army killed senior Al-Shabaab commanders in Lower Shabelle. Somalia condemned the Mandera attack that killed eight Kenyan citizens. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQamN3WS1Oa19oQk5pcFRjS1N0dkI0aFJtWXh4V3hlMDRDektYV1lwUkRvVHZUZzJMSWFDUlRxMkNFUVpPZFpVc3hwZmU4OTJpWGNYdXd0bU45UTE2U2trX29OOHkzUzdiMDRLUjBoV000eGp0cTBYQXdacW9iMmUxbXFNMzRlaEVlbjI1ZURwX284ZnZlUEM0aWNFLV94RDk0OGwwTVRudG1kQkx2U1JTd2cwSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kenyans.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPT0ZadTdGTVdMZEZtMEFfS3QtanBVbWp4ekpDLTlLekJYV3A5ZVlFRHptbV9GLTViYTgzTzhCanVqdlpGVGNLcFhHY3M2Umdva1JFMGtkUlA1SHdmbDNaRl91TEtLZVVMek9uMlZGT2NISFNjYjJkb2NtMUhsUF84ZVpzdU81Q1lqTjhDWF93?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Independent Uganda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt